  "content": "<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fjarva.bloom.host%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://ars.guide/banner.gif\" alt=\"\"></a> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/LICENSE-LGPL--3.0-fe7d37?style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"\"> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/TAVnu2xqrR\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Discord-6A7EC2?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=ffffff&amp;color=7389D8\" alt=\"\"></a></p><h2><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Ars Nouveau 的全域模態相容模組</span></strong></h2><ul>\n<li>需要 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ars-nouveau\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ars Nouveau</a></li>\n<li>需要 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/allthemodium\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Allthemodium</a> 以啟用配方</li>\n<li>可選配方支援 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ars-elemental\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ars Elemental</a></li>\n</ul><p>新增了由 Allthemodium、Vibranium 和 Unobtanium 製成的法師護甲，並提供完全可自訂的屬性與能力。</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/CjWrGh3.png\" alt=\"護甲展示\"></p>",
